    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edde4905639379f8",
      "translationZh": "过去一周，我一直在我的 5090 上深入比较 Qwen3.8-27B 的各种量化版本，结果偶然发现了一件确实让我惊讶的事。我找不到其他人讨论这个，所以想着分享一下。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baf39f5f081941f0",
      "translationZh": "测试配置：我比较了在本地运行 Qwen3.8-27B 的两种方式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f4f55dd39aeaa03a",
      "translationZh": "NInfer + NVFP4（底层使用 Unsloth 的 Dynamic NVFP4 权重）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6593571a3b8dcc16",
      "translationZh": "我在两者上都运行了 IFBench（50 个样本，seed 42），先使用默认采样参数：temp=1.0，min_p=0.0。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ca902f3c52c27da8",
      "translationZh": "我首先看的是提示级严格指标。Q5 比 NVFP4 略高几分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5cffcd6f48a4c9e1",
      "translationZh": "乍一看，Q5 赢了，对吧？我一开始也是这么想的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc31cb69bb0378e4",
      "translationZh": "但随后，我注意到了一件奇怪的事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
